---
config:
  flowchart:
    nodeSpacing: 150
    rankSpacing: 80
  themeVariables:
    edgeLabelBackground: 'transparent'
---
sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant Vigilo
    participant DB as Vigilo DB

    User->>Vigilo: vigilo run create
    activate Vigilo

    Vigilo->>Vigilo: Load and parse profile and dataset inputs
    Vigilo->>Vigilo: Canonicalize payloads and validate dataset
    Vigilo->>DB: Validate profile executability
    DB-->>Vigilo: Runnable evaluator summary

    Vigilo->>Vigilo: Plan case blobs, dataset version, run, chunks, and shard dispatch cursors
    Vigilo->>DB: Store run creation records in transaction

    alt Run creation committed
        DB-->>Vigilo: Run, dataset, case, chunk, and shard cursor records saved
        Vigilo->>Vigilo: Build run creation payload
        Vigilo-->>User: Success response
    else Validation or persistence fails
        DB-->>Vigilo: Error
        Vigilo-->>User: Run creation error
    end

    deactivate Vigilo
